AddAntenna 55     2122.28    -1138.08       21.69
AddAntenna 78      107.85       -8.26       54.74
AddAntenna 81     1113.87        5.93       40.00
AddAntenna 85     2618.46     -842.78       17.12
AddAntenna 88     -889.17      -13.24       68.82
AddAntenna 102     -400.22      842.04       67.31
